{"schemaVersion":1,"moduleId":"M3-04","example":{"title":"公車","intro":"一起檢視專用道、進出端與站位，維持公車動線的連續與可辨識性。","items":[{"id":"continuity","title":"專用道與進出端連續銜接","text":"整合路段、路口及站位周邊的導引，減少一般車流與路邊停車干擾。"},{"id":"trajectory","title":"幾何配置配合公車軌跡","text":"檢核島頭、槽化與進出端線型，避免公車偏移或輾壓交通島。"},{"id":"markings","title":"用設施表達專用與進出規則","text":"搭配專用道標誌、禁止變換車道線及導引線，清楚安排車流進出及轉向。"},{"id":"stops","title":"保留停靠與上下車操作空間","text":"檢查站位前後淨空、漸變與導引，也把行人及自行車銜接一起納入。"}],"moduleId":"M3-04","pageId":"results-module-m3-04","images":[{"key":"results:module-m3-04-current-1","role":"current","label":"現況問題 1","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m3-04-current-2","role":"current","label":"現況問題 2","rotation":0},{"key":"results:module-m3-04-diagram","role":"module","label":"模組圖","rotation":90}],"source":{"file":"chapters/03-modules/11-bus.typ","sha256":"84d738415338014d4afbb24bc1b056c9c23ce1e37891968220be87f2e9f72ead","title":"公車","moduleId":"M3-04","section":"現況與議題、圖例說明及延伸應用","issuePageId":"m304-lane-issues","diagramPageId":"m304-lane-diagram","representative":"materials/03-modules/M3-04/M3-04_公車專用道代表型.svg"}},"assets":{"results:module-m3-04-current-1":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M3-04/M3-04.1_現況議題_01.png","width":1130,"height":497,"moduleId":"M3-04","role":"current","label":"M3-04 現況問題 1","sha256":"6ecb209a4f505d719a94f52aede0d2160a209d942b4a855950a56b10432028ae"},"results:module-m3-04-current-2":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M3-04/M3-04.1_現況議題_02.png","width":1531,"height":969,"moduleId":"M3-04","role":"current","label":"M3-04 現況問題 2","sha256":"411e33075ab6c34b26d1e08b3afcfece2a26c0aeeed1d7fa8f5ee467aa2833f2"},"results:module-m3-04-diagram":{"file":"materials/03-modules/M3-04/M3-04_公車專用道代表型.svg","width":892,"height":1637,"moduleId":"M3-04","role":"module","label":"M3-04 模組圖","sha256":"2a24dd4e3c2bb64c2c7b1df0f057283193c6bc2a2376b5507dd8557c9c79449a"}}}
